  "solution": {
    "text": "Direct nitration of aniline with nitric acid gives a complex mixture of mono, di- and tri-nitro compounds and oxidation products. If $-\\mathrm{NH}_{2}$ group is protected by acetylation and then nitrated with nitrating mixture, $p$ -isomer is the main product.\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2013_che_a26.png\">",
